# Replaces Stow's built-in ignore list entirely, so the defaults we still
# want are repeated here. Anything matched is NOT symlinked into $HOME.

# Repo metadata (Stow defaults)
\.git
\.gitignore
^/README.*
^/LICENSE.*
^/COPYING
.+~
\#.*\#

# Repo-only files — records, docs and manifests, not config to install.
# Anything listed here would otherwise be symlinked into $HOME as if it were
# config. `loaf doctor` checks for exactly that leak.
^/packages\.txt$
^/CONTEXT\.md$
^/CLAUDE\.md$
^/docs$
^/packages$
^/migrations$
^/test$
^/lab$

# Theme files are COPY-class, not symlink-class: omarchy-theme-set stages a
# user theme with cp -r, which copies a stow symlink as a symlink — relative,
# so it dangles at the staging path and the override silently never applies
# (measured 2026-08-15 with tokyo-night/shell.bar.toml). loaf heal installs
# these as real files instead; loaf doctor checks them byte-for-byte.
^/\.config/omarchy/themes$

# Herdr mods are COPY-class too: Herdr rewrites files inside its mod folders,
# and through stow links those writes landed in this repo (2026-11-10: every
# mod file became a self-referencing link, originals .displaced). The
# herdr-mods-sync script copies them in instead, and its path unit re-runs it
# whenever Herdr updates.
^/\.config/herdr-app/mods$
